      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BANDIT DARYL (1) has an excellent record here having never missed the placings in seven starts, including five wins and two placings. Was out of placings last time (42.43) at Sandown in a S/E Group 1, finishing seventh and beaten 12 lengths. Looks a key chance on best form. LAMIA TAYA (2) prominent throughout and boxed on soundly to finish in the minors when second (29.99) at Murray Bridge in Grade 4/5. Has been out the placings in all two runs here. Overdue and expected to feature again. RIGHT TO RUN (8) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at his last four runs. Last start finished 2nd on September 3 over 595m at this track behind Gina Gulla beaten one length (34.83) in a Special conditions race. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Expected to feature. ADHANA MADI (6) was in the money last start and likely to feature again.",
